  "body": "Looking for a home that's sunny, stylish and easy to maintain? This beautifully designed, brand-new single-level home in Strathmill, Orewa, combines modern comfort with thoughtful features and a welcoming atmosphere. Enjoy sunshine in the north-facing living area, stylish built-in cabinetry and the convenience of central air conditioning. With sliding doors from both the living area and master bedroom opening directly onto the sunny deck, this home offers effortless indoor-outdoor living, perfect for relaxing or entertaining.\r\n\r\nFeatures You Will Love:\r\n\r\n•  3 bedrooms and 2 modern bathrooms, including a master ensuite\r\n•  Single-level design offering easy, low-maintenance living\r\n•  Sunny north-facing lounge filled with natural light\r\n•  Sliding doors from both the living area and master bedroom opening directly onto the sunny deck\r\n•  Open-plan kitchen and dining, perfect for everyday living and entertaining\r\n•  Custom built-in TV unit and display cabinetry adding style and practical storage\r\n•  Central air conditioning for year-round comfort\r\n•  Private backyard offering a relaxing outdoor retreat\r\n•  Single internal-access garage plus one off-street parking space\r\n•  Pre-wiring for future EV charger installation\r\n•  Intercom system for added convenience\r\n•  186m² (more or less) freehold section\r\n•  10-Year Master Build Guarantee for added peace of mind\r\n•  Handy to Orewa Beach, schools, shops and cafés, and within the Orewa College zone\r\n\r\nOne Community. Multiple Homes. One Easy Tour!\r\n\r\nWhy visit one home when you can explore several?\r\n\r\nWe have a great selection of brand-new homes throughout Strathmill, offering different layouts, sizes and features to suit your lifestyle and budget.\r\n\r\nCall Brianna and Brian to book your personalised Strathmill Home Tour – compare multiple homes in one convenient visit!\r\n\r\nViewing Directions: Via Flavell Road, or GPS to 251 West Hoe Heights, Orewa. Follow the Strathmill signs.",
